 "later_lines": [
  "earl: \"Deal's mine. Watch my hands, if you like.\"",
  "stranger: \"Evening. Mind if I sit in a while?\"",
  "cody: \"Earl, you cheating son of a bitch!\"",
  "stranger: \"Don't move, friend. Whatever happens next, you sit still.\"",
  "earl: \"Now, Cody, I never...\"",
  "cody: \"Ain't no law left in this valley to save you now, Earl.\"",
  "barkeep: \"Jesus, Cody, my chair!\"",
  "stranger: \"You didn't see a thing tonight. Nobody did. Remember that.\"",
  "pianist: \"Is he done, you reckon?\"",
  "barkeep: \"Somebody ought to fetch the... hell. Ain't nobody left to fetch.\"",
  "barkeep: \"He's breathing. Harlan. You. Get him up to Doc's.\"",
  "rancher: \"Is it done?\"",
  "saloon_girl: \"Who was it? Anybody see?\"",
  "liveryman: \"I'm too old for this.\"",
  "loudmouth: \"Somebody tell me that's the end of it.\"",
  "fiddler: \"Is it over?\"",
  "barkeep: \"Go on! He can't lie there.\"",
  "storekeeper: \"Damn fool, whoever it was.\"",
  "runner: \"Harlan! Doc's asking for you. Says the sheriff's sinking.\""
